  "definitions": [
    "All 128 registered opportunities remain in the denominator; illegal starts have no control actions and are not retries.",
    "52 expert recoveries are not student autonomous successes. Labels count actual valid expert controls after queue flush, not optimizer exposure.",
    "64 new initial families each have A and B opportunities; 128 trajectories are not 128 independent initial families. A/B use real A08/B06 complete students and separate batch RNG streams; no exact hidden-state pairing or causal policy comparison.",
    "Held12 is latest12 completed student transitions with >=2 fingers >0.1N in both120Hz samples and object height >=median student completed25..48+20mm. Old stable adds palm-relative1cm/0.2rad; native lift is a different original task condition.",
    "No held window, elapsed delay without a current held window, no takeover, native fall/drop, expert failure and native timeout are distinct; no-trigger is not proof that the object was dropped.",
    "Entry schedules are collection entrances, not action-stage labels. Fixed40/80 expert suffixes contain subsequent grasp, turn, alignment and insertion actions.",
    "Actual action stages use PRE-action native success count:0 preinsert pose,1 final pose50mm lower,2 release/retract before original retract_succeeded completion. These are native task stages, not a claim that every stage1 action physically inserts. Contact/two-finger/near/alignment/lift masks overlap; do not add them.",
    "Native subgoal advancement resets the original stage clock. Total control counts above601 are allowed without changing timeout; no manual timer reset was introduced.",
    "Final owner-to-owner throughput includes startup, rendering, complete student, recording, verification and admission. Worker timing overlaps and cannot be added to wall time; varying sources/schedules/concurrent work prevent a causal speed comparison.",
    "Only metadata and missing small numeric stage fields were read. Prior A64/B16 physical audits were reused; this export does not repeat185-field payload verification or full-HDF5, RGB, model or DINO hashing."
  ],
